            <div xml:id="d614">

                <pb facs="0825" n="711" xml:id="pg711"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">702.1211/1103: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of the State of New York</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Miller</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Albany</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-10-27"><hi rendition="#italic">October 27,
                        1922</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 6:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your telegram of 27th relative Mexico Central Administration received, matter
                    referred to Attorney General of the State to take immediate steps to ascertain
                    if purpose set forth can be accomplished. Advise you later.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Nathan L. Miller</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
